# Spec §8.4 name-matching fixtures. Written before tuning; the matcher is tuned to these, never the reverse.
#
# expect:  STRONG = must be a STRONG match
#          MATCH  = must be retained (POSSIBLE or STRONG)
#          WEAK   = must NOT be STRONG (POSSIBLE or discarded both acceptable); excluded from precision/recall
